1
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,520
I wonder

2
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:24,360
what Wang Jiming's last words were.

3
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,840
9 p.m.

4
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,440
The old house of the Lin family.

5
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,520
Go alone.

6
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:29,960
No waiting after the time.

7
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,840
The truth will be buried forever.

8
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,360
[The number you dialed is temporarily unavailable.]

9
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,320
[Sorry,]

10
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:40,240
[the number you dialed is temporarily unavailable.]

11
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:55,840
The last sentence.

12
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:58,760
Did Jiming not die on the spot?

13
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:00,560
Then what did he leave behind?

14
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,760
The bait has been set.

15
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,560
Now we'll see if the fish

16
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:56,200
are greedy enough.

17
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,600
Yu,

18
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:22,640
are you home?

19
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:23,640
I'm coming to you.

20
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,320
Let's go over the clues again.

21
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:27,600
I'm not feeling well.

22
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,240
Let's talk tomorrow.

23
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,240
Not feeling well?

24
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,120
What's wrong?

25
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,280
Do you need me to come over?

26
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:32,840
I'm fine.

27
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:34,840
I just have a headache.

28
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:36,440
I'll talk to you tomorrow.

29
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,800
How dare you call me?

30
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:05,720
Jiming,

31
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,680
go to the ancestral house now.

32
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:07,480
Ms. Wen

33
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,520
asked me to prepare something

34
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:11,800
and went to the ancestral house alone.

35
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:14,160
I heard her talking

36
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:14,920
on the phone

37
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,480
with Lawyer Guan.

38
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,240
I'm afraid...

39
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,000
What?

40
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,600
I'm afraid something bad is going to happen.

41
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,760
When did she go there?

42
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:22,680
Not long ago.

43
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:46,880
Coming.

44
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,800
Please have some tea.

45
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:54,240
Director Wen, you went to great lengths to invite me here.

46
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:57,000
It's not just for a simple tea, right?

47
00:03:58,040 --> 00:03:59,760
What did Jiming say in the end?

48
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,520
Sit.

49
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,520
Don't be afraid.

50
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,080
It's just the two of us.

51
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:10,960
I just want

52
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,560
to talk to you alone.

53
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,840
After all, only the two of us

54
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,720
know what happened before,

55
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,480
don't we?

56
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,800
Gu Qingyu,

57
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:36,880
just say it.

58
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,120
Take your time.

59
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,360
Have some tea first

60
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,320
to soothe your throat.

61
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,440
This is the Pu'er tea

62
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,240
Mu Yun loved the most.

63
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,480
It's a pity

64
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,760
he can't drink it anymore.

65
00:04:58,920 --> 00:04:59,600
What?

66
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,720
Are you afraid I'll poison you?

67
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:37,240
Wang Jiming

68
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,640
was in great pain.

69
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,280
Before the explosion,

70
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:42,400
he seemed to have foreseen something.

71
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:43,600
He said

72
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,760
he regretted it.

73
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:46,640
What did he regret?

74
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,240
He regretted

75
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,560
marrying you.

76
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,160
The tea is drunk.

77
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,840
You can go now.

78
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,280
You can't go.

79
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:05,680
You don't look well.

80
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:07,600
This old house is too damp.

81
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,120
You shouldn't stay here too long.

82
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,600
Goodbye.

83
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,320
You...

84
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,520
My cup!

85
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,120
Xintian.

86
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:15,800
Xintian.

87
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:16,960
Xintian.

88
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,080
Xintian.

89
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,200
Xintian.

90
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:27,720
Xintian.

91
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:52,760
Doctor,

92
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,200
how is she?

93
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,040
She is suffering from food poisoning,

94
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,520
accompanied by signs of acute kidney failure.

95
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,560
The situation is very dangerous.

96
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,560
Fortunately, she was brought here in time.

97
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,200
We are doing our best to save her.

98
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,200
What did she eat?

99
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:06,600
I don't know.

100
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,000
Gastric lavage,

101
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,760
dialysis, and medication.

102
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,040
We need the patient's family to sign.

103
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:11,920
Okay.

104
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:12,680
I'll sign.

105
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,120
Doctor,

106
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:20,400
please,

107
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,720
you must save her.

108
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,960
We'll do our best.

109
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:47,760
You're awake.

110
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,120
How do you feel?

111
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:53,800
The doctor told me

112
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,240
you had severe food poisoning.

113
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:56,600
What did you eat yesterday?

114
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,320
I don't

115
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,520
know.

116
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:04,120
Maybe it's because of the takeout.

117
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:05,000
Takeout?

118
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,520
How can it cause acute kidney failure?

119
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:09,400
Yu,

120
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,400
