121
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,800
Who sent me here?

122
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,080
Lin Jiming.

123
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,160
He contacted me.

124
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:21,400
Where is he?

125
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,640
I'm really fine.

126
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:37,840
I'm just a bit tired.

127
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,360
I need to rest a bit more.

128
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:45,960
Alright.

129
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,800
Then get some rest.

130
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,800
Where did she go last night?

131
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:02,360
Where exactly did you find her?

132
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:03,760
Stop asking.

133
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:06,400
She doesn't want to talk about it right now.

134
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,440
Lin Jiming.

135
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,240
This wasn't an accident.

136
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:10,640
I know.

137
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,720
Let her decide for herself.

138
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,560
She's been through enough.

139
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:31,640
Tiantian.

140
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:58,480
Are you okay?

141
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,520
You look pale.

142
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:02,960
I'm fine.

143
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:04,880
Go ahead.

144
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:07,440
Well,

145
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,760
my brother helped me.

146
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:11,880
So we found that

147
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,800
Wen Shiyi is very quick,

148
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,120
but not quick enough.

149
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:17,560
In the past 72 hours,

150
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:20,640
she transferred at least 530 million yuan

151
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:23,400
through seven overseas shell companies.

152
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:25,520
The money was finally transferred to South America.

153
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:26,960
The account holder is

154
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:28,000
Qi Zhou.

155
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,760
Qi Zhou.

156
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,680
Zhou Qi.

157
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,120
So he's hiding in South America.

158
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,440
And there's something more crucial.

159
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:38,720
I've traced back

160
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,440
the IP address used

161
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,720
when she executed these transactions.

162
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,440
The source is in this city.

163
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:44,720
Binhai District.

164
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,640
Abandoned pier.

165
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:48,720
So,

166
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,680
she's alive.

167
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:50,800
Yes.

168
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,680
She was saved.

169
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,200
Zhan Shan

170
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:05,200
Get ready.

171
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,360
It's time to go.
